-off or justify why the chosen balance is optimal from a utilitarian perspe=
ctive. This omission constitutes a divergence from the framework=E2=80=99s =
maximization and aggregation principles, which require transparent consider=
ation of such trade-offs.</p><p>**Maximization and Demandingness**</p><p>Cl=
assical utilitarianism=E2=80=99s maximization principle demands that agents=
 always act to produce the best possible outcome. The Karma mechanism=E2=80=
=99s design as a repeated auction with bidding strategies based on urgency =
and Karma balances suggests an ongoing optimization process among agents. T=
he use case=E2=80=99s modeling of Stationary Nash Equilibria and rational a=
