s would enhance legitimacy and stability by ensuring that Karma is part of =
a well-ordered society=E2=80=99s basic structure.</p><p>Fourth, the use-cas=
e should engage with non-ideal theory by analyzing political resistance, in=
stitutional inertia, and practical pathways to implement Karma in real-worl=
d contexts. This includes strategies to build public trust, manage inactive=
 users, and ensure market liquidity without undermining fairness.</p><p>Fif=
th, the use-case would benefit from incorporating the method of reflective =
equilibrium by soliciting and integrating considered judgments from diverse=
