es. The mechanism proposed seeks to optimize the allocation of road usage b=
y allowing individuals to earn Karma points through non-consumption (i.e., =
not driving) and to spend these points when they need to use the roads. Suc=
cess in this context is defined not only by the reduction of congestion but=
